OL,3,GNEWSACrash victim to hike Sussex coast
OL,4,Ain armour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car crash victim who said he was told
OL,7,Fhe would never walk again is to hike
OL,8,Fthe Sussex coast in full armour.
OL,10,FGav Collins, who goes by the name of
OL,11,Fthe Strolling Saxon, suffered spinal
OL,12,Finjuries in 2023 after his vehicle was
OL,13,Fstruck by another while stationary.
OL,15,FOn Saturday the 55-year-old fundraiser
OL,16,Fis beginning a 10-day trek along the
OL,17,FSussex coast from Chichester to Rye.
OL,19,FIt will take in the 960th anniversary
OL,20,Fof the Battle of Hastings on 14
OL,21,FOctober.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
